          %p
            This can be understood as a “(directed)
            = succeed "\u201D" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"} homotopy pullback
          %p
            If one defines, as one does, a (possiby
            = succeed ")" do
